			hint = "See the powder safely to the excavation.",
			unlock = {
				{ type = "quest", id = 309 },
			},
			text = [=[{link:jern-hornhelm}Jern Hornhelm{/link} had sent powder weeks before, and it never came. The next shipment went by porters along the curve of {link:the-loch}the Loch{/link}, and on the road the {link:dark-iron-dwarves}Dark Irons{/link} struck. One of the porters, Saean, was their man, though he had worked beside the others for nearly a year. When Miran brought the rest of the powder through at last, Ironband was glad of it, and troubled that the Dark Irons had friends able to lay hands on such things.]=],
